# NETWORK — no NIC (pci_scan / virtio_net_init above find none). The addresses are the x86 vars' pre-DHCP 0; nic_ready is
# 0 so the shell's net verbs print "no network" first; the rest refuse like x86's no-NIC paths (nic_mac zero-fills as
# r8169.cyr's does).
